@startuml v2_D8_FeedbackComplaint
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  ArrowColor Black
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}

title D8 - Feedback & Complaint (UC50-UC54, all Phase 2)

actor "Student" as STU
actor "Club Management Board" as CMB
actor "ICPDP Officer" as ICPDP

rectangle UCMS {
  usecase UC50 as "UC50
  Submit post-event feedback"
  usecase UC51 as "UC51
  Review event feedback"
  usecase UC52 as "UC52
  Submit a complaint about a club"
  usecase UC53 as "UC53
  Triage a complaint"
  usecase UC54 as "UC54
  Respond to a forwarded complaint"
  usecase UC42 as "UC42
  Manage violation and compliance cases
  (see D6)"
}

UC53 ..> UC42 : <<extend>>

STU -- UC50
STU -- UC52

CMB -- UC51
CMB -- UC54

ICPDP -- UC53

note bottom of UC54
  Added in v2: v1 sent the transition
  "Forwarded -> Club Responded" to CMB under UC57,
  an ICPDP use case, so the state had no owner.
end note

note bottom of UC53
  Escalation needs UC42, which is why the whole group
  ships in the same phase. v1 put UC56/UC57 in the MVP
  and UC48 in V2, so an escalated complaint had
  nowhere to go.
end note
@enduml
